+# Tiger City reachable sign copy
+
+Text-only follow-up to TaichungBoulevard_BufferTigerCitySign in src/taichung_boulevard_landmarks.c. Only two existing literals change. The active map43:29 post21,13 calls TaichungBoulevard_Sign_TigerCity, which shows this buffer then routes to stable encounter14. Preserve its existing lock, replay guard, capture offer and progress.
+
+Four short pages in English and Traditional Chinese, at most two lines per page, max179px using the conservative native font width audit. Sources and exact page breaks are in tiger-city.json. No hours, tenants, dates or fictional historical claims. The official source supports the Henan Road Section3 address, shopping/dining/cinema, direct-outdoor open B1 and transparent lift over the outdoor plaza.
+
+Five glyphs 俯河瞰購透 are a separate append-only companion after the arrival-glyph checkpoint1073. No prior mapping or bitmap changes. Full native build and both actual ARM encoded strings pass; buffer lengths are below gStringVar4[1000]. No map, script, compiler, capture mechanics or The Lin content is installed by this handoff. Main owns final ROM/HD pairing and preview.
