+    "TaichungPlace_NameConfuciusZh": "臺中孔廟",
+    "TaichungGym_Text_ConfuciusGreetingEn": "I'm Wenyi. I guide visitors\nthrough the temple.",
+    "TaichungGym_Text_ConfuciusGreetingZh": "我是文儀，\n在這裡帶遊客認識建築。",
