+    "TaichungGym_Text_ConfuciusIntroEn": "This temple follows\nSong-dynasty design.",
+    "TaichungGym_Text_ConfuciusIntroZh": "這座孔廟採用\n宋代宮殿式建築。",
+    "TaichungGym_Text_ConfuciusDefeatEn": "You kept a clear head!",
+    "TaichungGym_Text_ConfuciusDefeatZh": "你的思路很清楚！",
+    "TaichungGym_Text_ConfuciusDeclinedEn": "Sure. Have a look around.",
+    "TaichungGym_Text_ConfuciusDeclinedZh": "沒問題，先到處看看吧。",
+    "TaichungGym_Text_ConfuciusAlreadyEn": "Your Rites Badge is recorded.\nEnjoy the rest of the city!",
+    "TaichungGym_Text_ConfuciusAlreadyZh": "城市護照已有禮儀徽章。\n繼續探索吧！",
+    "TaichungGym_Text_ConfuciusLossEn": "Let's pause and try again.\nTake your time.",
+    "TaichungGym_Text_ConfuciusLossZh": "先歇一會兒，再來試吧。\n慢慢想，不著急。",
+    "TaichungGym_Text_ConfuciusNotRecordedEn": "No new badge was recorded.\nYou're welcome to try again.",
+    "TaichungGym_Text_ConfuciusNotRecordedZh": "沒有新增徽章。\n歡迎再挑戰！",
+    "TaichungGym_Text_ConfuciusUnavailableEn": "Bring a POKéMON partner\nwhen you're ready to battle.",
+    "TaichungGym_Text_ConfuciusUnavailableZh": "帶寶可夢夥伴\n來對戰吧！",
+    "TaichungGym_Text_ConfuciusCompleteEn": "Thoughtfully done! Take\nthe Rites Badge!",
+    "TaichungGym_Text_ConfuciusCompleteZh": "沉著又有禮！\n禮儀徽章交給你！",
+    "sStaffEn": "I start tours with the roof.\nTwo tiers of yellow tiles.",
+    "sStaffZh": "我帶人看建築，先看屋頂。\n重檐搭配黃色琉璃瓦。",
+    "sShenJiGuideEn": "I'm Axiu. I make things here.\nThese homes date from 1969.",
