@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+# Reusable resident conversations
+
+The canonical ten bilingual conversations are implemented in commit abfa9fd8, with the registered-glyph shopping-copy fix in ac460097. Maps/Main explicitly confirmed that these may be repeated among the55newroaming regularresidents. The city target is exactly75outdoorNPCs=20existing+55new. The earlier ten-person placement draft is part of those55, not an additional ten.
+
+Use dialogue-pool.json entries[].script for each new regular resident. District/activity tags are suggestions; every line is original incidental fiction and may be reused. The canonical label names do not create landmark pins or fixed affiliations. Maps owns final localIDs, exact55bindings, walking routes, sprite choices and total75audit. Existing gym/landmark affiliates remain fixed.
+
+Main includes `data/scripts/taichung_ambient_npcs.inc` once, without duplicate temporary definitions. No glyph extension is required after ac460097. All 20 strings were extracted from the actual ARM object and checked against the unchanged native charmap. Native lines are at most 193px. Twenty actual C translations and ten actual ASM conversation paths pass: one page then release, no menus, battle/capture hooks, quests or saved writes; quest-log replay skips speech. The reuse manifest adds no runtime behavior. Actual 55-NPC placement, conversation and roaming acceptance belongs to Maps/Main.
+
+The player sprite comparison video is a separate standalone review asset; no player variant is installed by this package.
