+# Capture-only Gameplay source qualification
+
+Input: immutable Main `ae3c49b2ee8909b57cad1e93343ac6abe68ff3ed`, plus the
+explicit declaration-order fix `81259fe5c8e9279aa70551f3909e2226f45e3565`.
+This branch changes guards, metadata, focused tests and documentation. Main's
+fix was cherry-picked unchanged; no further runtime/script/font/map edit is made.
+
+`capture_gameplay_guard.py` registers all32 files of the accepted bridge,
+Scyther-helper and field/Team slices, including18 edited and14 added inputs.
+Their source corresponds to Gameplay `e91cd16`, `a362967`, `7f4cb75`, integrated
+by Main at `7759775`. The one reviewed exception is Main's C89 fix: only
+`u8 speedVar` and its blank line move above the scoped run hook. Removing that
+declaration from each version leaves the same token sequence.
+
+The layer verifies every actual input and its dependencies before reversing
+unique, exact text hunks to immutable `8d3694b` bytes. Added implementations are
+verified actual source, not synthesized stubs. No SaveC/H, geometry, warp,
+anchor or unrelated source is substituted. The source concerns Wenchang only;
+the other13 wrappers remain APIs. A verified historical view does not establish
+native battle, browser durability or map13 acceptance.
+
+The nine pre-existing gym-guard-owned Gameplay inputs are qualified as part of
+that complete slice: curated TSV/profiles/header, menu/team headers, script
+menu, Team implementation/menu and Team tests. The capture-init registration,
+old gym manifest, all older profiles and all original corruption probes remain
+byte-identical. The gym reader first proves capture initialization, then this
+separate increment. Its returned view also propagates exact newer inputs not
+owned by the room layer, such as the Wenchang binding and main-loop tick, to
+older source guards. Unknown edits remain live for their owning guard.
+
+Main's known font append is a separate component of the same registration:
+786→808 rows. It proves the whole old charmap prefix and all786 raster rows
+byte-identical, exactly22 new characters at indices786..807, matching FC19
+encodings and12×14 bounded masks, and no change outside those new rows. It also
+pins the exact known payloads from Main `a81f0734`. No font generation or edit is
+performed by this helper.
+
+Source audit/host validation includes the existing capture-slice audit (native
+catch odds/RNG body retained; temporary supplies; dedicated unlock/Team gate;
+14 stable species/levels), bridge generation/mask/sequence checks and the actual
+field adapter's no-battle-before-ACK/result-ACK flows. It does not replace Main's
+GBA/browser acceptance. The Task-queue and additional-site follow-ups in
+Gameplay's later branch are outside this exact accepted input.
+
+Commands (Pillow supplied here through `.tools/python-lib`):
+
+```sh
+PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 -B tools/taichung/capture_gameplay_guard.py --self-test
+PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 -B tests/test_capture_gameplay_guard.py
+PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 -B tools/taichung/gym_interiors_guard.py --self-test
+PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 -B tools/taichung/home_start.py --self-test
+PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 -B tools/taichung/approved_art_guard.py --historical all --self-test
+PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 -B tools/taichung_gameplay/audit-encounter-slice.py
+bash tools/taichung_gameplay/test-encounter-bridge.sh
+bash tools/taichung_gameplay/test-encounter-field.sh
+```
+
+Forty current-input/dependency changes, missing registration and four independent
+glyph corruptions must fail closed without an underlay. Focused integration
+tests bind current/baseline inputs to immutable Git and retain the original
+profile/probe text, verify foreign changes still fail their owning guard, and
+check that script/main-loop views reach the older layers. No old pin is updated.
