@@ -0,0 +1,63 @@
+# Existing-map capture release qualification
+
+This strict layer qualifies product `331326300a91da112cadaabdb2180ae5d544d98a`
+above capture-only Main `21633f77af0399a24e3c039d2f067037171706ad`. It retains
+released geometry `48fe4ba5208d0a2b1285c1b6aa6f776377ef003d5501e5ae837ca45c6127e92a`,
+save version12,21 native contexts and the exact808-glyph codebook. No horizontal
+map/compiler/module, new native ID, geometry, art, anchor or version is imported.
+
+The reviewed increment has seven edited inputs and six added inputs: the nine
+existing-site bindings, their metadata/audit/tests, startup-only virgin state
+initialization, two Team tutorial literals and presentation for exactly the four
+unbound site IDs10–13. All14 unlock gates/masks and existing party usability
+remain unchanged. The old nearby landmark directions remain literal.
+
+Current inputs and162 unchanged dependencies are hash-bound before the seven
+exact prior inputs are yielded to the unchanged field-fix, encounter-init,
+capture and gym/home/art proofs. The prior copies ship in a separately pinned
+portable ZIP. There are no map/layout/bank replacements in this view. Only the
+six verified added files and this layer's two data files are hidden; no new
+namespace/directory exclusion can hide a foreign sibling.
+
+The guard independently compares15 historical repair arrays,24 save/facing
+helpers, the complete migration suffix after its original early return,22
+unrelated Team functions, all unchanged tutorial topics, three exact startup
+contexts and nine sign IDs with Wenchang preserved. The actual-C tests remain
+the authority for initialization, pending warps and byte preservation.
+
+One separately exact guard adapter carries certified tool overrides into the
+approved-art historical executable mirror. Its original source is restored
+before the old gym manifest reads it. All old manifests, hashes, profiles,
+registrations and corruption-probe bodies remain unchanged. Unknown battle or
+map changes stay live and fail their normal checks.
+
+## Verification
+
+```sh
+export PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1
+python3 -B tools/taichung/capture_release_guard.py --self-test
+python3 -B tests/test_capture_release_guard.py
+python3 -B tools/taichung/gym_interiors_guard.py --self-test
+python3 -B tools/taichung/home_start.py --self-test
+python3 -B tools/taichung/approved_art_guard.py --self-test
+python3 -B tools/taichung/approved_art_guard.py --historical all --self-test
+python3 -B tools/taichung_gameplay/test-capture-release.py
+python3 -B tools/taichung_gameplay/test-capture-release.py --previous-guard-tests
+```
+
+Art checks use Pillow. In this workspace set
+`PYTHONPATH=/Users/peter/devday_hackathon/.tools/python-lib` and use
+`/Users/peter/.pyenv/versions/3.11.15/bin/python3`. The source proof itself needs
+neither Git nor a compiler; immutable provenance tests and existing regression
+runners can use local Git. No ARM build or UI runs in this guard work.
+
