+# Gym recovery rule
+
+The native opening/settings menu includes **Heal after gym battles / 道館戰後恢復**.
+It defaults to On for fresh and previously created saves. Saved variable 0x40FE
+was unused in the production baseline: 0/unrecognized reads On, 1 means On and 2
+means Off. Reads use the current save directly, never quest-log replay, and do
+not mutate old saves. Accepting settings stores the explicit choice with normal
+save data. No bridge or save-layout change is required.
+
+Gym entry does not recover HP, PP, status or fainted partners, with either
+setting. The existing preparation script API checks for a healthy non-egg party
+member and returns the existing unavailable result for an empty/all-fainted/egg
+party. It performs only necessary level/preset maintenance. Level changes retain
+absolute HP clamped to the new maximum, so living partners remain alive and
+fainted partners remain fainted. Correct presets retain exact PP; an outdated
+preset retains PP per slot, clamped to the new move's maximum. Identity, captured
+level, held items and status survive maintenance. Explicit team preparation and
+new team choices retain their existing behavior and controls.
+
+Only a matching, prepared, actually started registered gym leader victory that
+successfully records new progress can trigger recovery. On calls the existing
+native `HealPlayerParty`: full HP, PP including PP Ups, cleared status and faint
+recovery for the party. Off leaves ordinary battle HP, PP and status in place.
+Duplicate/untracked/wrong-trainer completions cannot heal. Trainer registration,
+progress masks and consume-once badge awards retain their existing safeguards.
+
+Losses use the existing trainer defeat callback and ordinary whiteout flow,
+including normal full recovery and respawn regardless of this setting. The
+option does not change guest-house healing or explicit preparation.
+
+Story overlap is limited to the body of `TaichungGym_ScriptPrepareChallenge` in
+`src/taichung_gym_adapter.c`; its arguments/result are unchanged. All Station
+text, gym scripts and dialogue are untouched. No new script call is needed.
+
+## Focused native evidence
+
+- `python3 -B tools/taichung_gameplay/test-gym-healing.py`: actual preparation,
+  battle-end, full-heal, PP calculation and whiteout function bodies with real
+  team/progress/options C; 40 entry/victory cases across ten gyms and stored
+  unset/On/Off/invalid preferences. Checks damaged and fainted partners before
+  entry, post-win HP/PP/PP Ups/status, duplicates, untracked/wrong trainers,
+  all-fainted/egg entry rejection, necessary legacy normalization, and loss
+  recovery/respawn with both choices. Also runs existing team regressions.
+- `python3 -B tools/taichung_gameplay/test-gym-healing-menu.py`: actual native
+  opening/OPTION input functions, defaults, saved Off, toggles/persistence and
+  all rows; added Chinese glyphs and vertical layout checked against native
+  13px small text in the 240x160 window.
+- Existing exploration preference, progress and badge reward host suites.
+
+These checks model engine services on the host; Main owns combined ROM/browser
+verification and presentation review.
