+# Confucius gym registration and save compatibility
+
+Gym index5 remains bit32 of VAR_0x40FA. `TAICHUNG_GYM_CONFUCIUS_TEMPLE`
+is canonical; `TAICHUNG_GYM_SHEN_JI` remains a source compatibility alias.
+No save migration or extra award is performed for a previously earned bit.
+The read-only City Pass and badge mailbox display that existing credit.
+
+Wenyi uses appended trainer762 (`TRAINER_TAICHUNG_CONFUCIUS_WENYI`), below
+unchanged `MAX_TRAINERS_COUNT=768`. Axiu remains748, permanently reserved.
+Challenge preparation now requires the exact registered leader of each slot,
+so stale Axiu scripts cannot grant slot5. Old Axiu trainer flags do not block
+an unearned Wenyi fight; existing completion bit32 blocks a duplicate award.
+The new roster is Slowbro, Exeggutor, Alakazam, each Lv50, no items, with the
+existing curated player presets and the independently reviewed AI flags7.
+Gym preparation does not heal; post-win preference and normal blackout remain.
+
+Maps owns `MAP_TAICHUNG_CONFUCIUS_GYM` (43:79), its door/return, and the
+visit-only old Shen Ji room43:8. Only the new room participates in the native
+one-partner gym reminder. No geometry, Continue repair or old interior moves
+are included here. Story supplies `TRAINER_PIC_TAICHUNG_WENYI` and its
+bilingual `taichung_confucius_gym.inc`. Main includes that script after the
+shared macro and forms the append-only Chinese glyph union.
+
+Shared native badge wiring is explicitly handed to Main: in
+`src/taichung_badges.c`, slot5 names must be Rites Badge / 禮儀徽章 and
+Confucius Temple / 臺中孔廟. Slot5 collection/award frames must use Story's
+exact `graphics/taichung/badges/rites-v1/05-confucius-temple-{16,32}.png`
+(palette unchanged). Retain the other9 frames and exported APIs unchanged.
+Story's native asset commit32ac2e8f and manifest384e80bc provide the exports.
+The existing20 archival PNGs and payload hashes should stay intact; frame5
+can point at separate packed Rites tiles. Main owns these shared-table edits
+and combined sprite verification, as permitted by its integration contract.
+
+Validation: real compiled progress C covers all1024 old completion masks,
+exact trainer/start/win and one-shot award/loss guards. Existing40 native
+healing cases, bilingual2048 City Pass grids,20 awards, mailbox, and4096 AI
+selector seeds pass. Full native build requires Story's graphics registration
+and Maps' appended map constant; Main integrates those independent inputs.
