+# Sharp badge masters — review v1
+
+Editable original256-viewBoxSVGs, transparent256/512/1024PNGs, and explicit slot/ID/name/native-fallback mapping are in data/taichung/story-confucius/badge-display-manifest-v1.json.
+
+The approved source SVGs were32-pixel rectangle wrappers, preserved under provenance/. The existing native PNGs match them exactly. These large-display masters are newly authored faithful redraws of our own icon designs, preserving recognizable motifs and colors; no recovered detail is claimed. Rites is an original temple/learning emblem. Craft is archived, separate from the ten active records. Wanhe's Tide icon retains its existing native maple-garden filename alias.
+
+All existing native icons/sheets and shared badge names/renderers are untouched. These files are visual review candidates; Interface owns rendering and Main final pairing/release. Generate using tools/taichung_story/create_badge_masters.py.
