@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# Wenyi / 文儀 — review v1
+
+Original fictional Taichung Confucius Temple gym leader: a patient, observant architecture volunteer and educator. Cream blouse, cinnabar vest, teal trousers, low bun, glasses and visitor notebook. Full-body64×64 battle sprite and ten16×32 standard animation cells. East uses native horizontal flip. Both indexed15opaque colors plus transparent0, RGB555 palettes. Tile roundtrip checked.
+
+Generated with built-in imagegen. Exact prompts and original generated sources are preserved here; tools/taichung_story/export_wenyi.py reproducibly fits/indexes/packs them. No registration or game binding is installed.
