+# Exact tower Continue repair
+
+Extends the existing v12 table from 70 to 95 exact collision-derived cells. The prior 70 source/target rows remain identical. No helper, SaveC, save header, schema, native return priority or map visuals change.
+
+Validation: generator/source comparison and 27,884 compiled helper cases pass. Ten actual mGBA paired Continue cases pass (ordinary native-menu saves, isolated pending fixtures and unchanged-position controls), preserving protected progression/party bytes, HP7 and first-move PP1. Repaired arrivals can walk free.
+
+Evidence: /Users/peter/devday_hackathon/artifacts/qa/2026-11-24-confucius-xitun/continue95/native-continue-results.json
+
+Unchanged native a701 ordinary saves for Main import and SHA256 receipts: /Users/peter/devday_hackathon/artifacts/qa/2026-11-24-confucius-xitun/continue95/immutable-ordinary-a701/manifest.json. These were saved through the original ROM menu after isolated bootstrap; no edits followed native Save. Pending fixtures are separate.
diff --git a/tools/taichung/boulevard_city/qa/named-xitun-continue/prepare.py b/tools/taichung/boulevard_city/qa/named-xitun-continue/prepare.py
