+"""Independently validate installed Greenway landmark increments, read-only.
+
+The manifest supplies addresses, not proof: source words, candidate foreground,
+palette entries, frozen primary, attributes and exact border strips are checked
+independently. Static checks do not claim a successful ROM walk or save migration.
+"""
