+for needle in ['KeepingCurrentPartner() ? TaichungText(sKeepEn, sKeepZh)','KeepingCurrentPartner() ? TaichungText(sKeepStatsEn, sKeepStatsZh)','KeepingCurrentPartner() ? TaichungText(sSavedMovesEn, sSavedMovesZh)']:assert needle in s
